---
metadata:
  layer: schema
  scope: schema/
  version: "1.0"
  description: Machine-readable format and profile schemas

template:
  required_files: [norm-schema.json]
  required_directories: [profiles/]
  single_source_of_truth:
    - source: norm-schema.json
      for: the machine-readable core format
    - source: profiles/
      for: profile-specific recommendations

agent_rules:
  update_order:
    - "Record the format decision"
    - "Update docs/SPEC.md"
    - "Update core and profile schemas"
    - "Update templates and behavior fixtures"
  reference_policy:
    target_must_exist: true
    allow_external: false
    require_description: true

strong_references:
  - type: source
    target: /docs/SPEC.md
    sync: auto_pull
    validation: strict
    description: The prose specification is authoritative
  - type: downstream
    target: /crates/norm-core/
    sync: auto_push
    validation: strict
    description: norm-core implements schema and semantic behavior
---

# Schema conventions

Schema changes are format changes and require same-commit contract coverage.
